---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="WARDOGS Community & US East Server | End of Day"
  description="Join End of Day, a US East WARDOGS community with its own community server at launch. Teamwork, familiar names, active admins, and low drama."
>
  <header class="topbar shell">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="End of Day home">
      <span class="brand-logo-frame" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/images/end-of-day-logo.png" alt="" />
      </span>
      <span class="brand-copy">
        <strong>END OF DAY</strong>
        <small>EOD • WARDOGS COMMUNITY</small>
      </span>
    </a>

    <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Page navigation">
      <a href="/wardogs-community" aria-current="page">COMMUNITY</a>
      <a href="/server">SERVER</a>
      <a href="/about">ABOUT</a>
      <a href="/rules">RULES</a>
      <a class="nav-button" href="/discord">DISCORD</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="subpage shell community-page">
    <section class="subpage-heading">
      <p class="section-index">EOD / WARDOGS COMMUNITY</p>
      <h1>A COMMUNITY<br />BUILT FOR THE<br /><em>REGULARS.</em></h1>
      <p>
        End of Day is a US East WARDOGS community for players who want
        teamwork, familiar names, and good fights without the sweat or drama.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="community-story">
      <div>
        <p class="section-index">WHY END OF DAY</p>
        <h2>A SERVER WHERE<br />YOU RECOGNIZE<br />THE NAMES.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="community-story-copy">
        <p>
          EOD was created by people with jobs, families, and busy lives. At the
          end of the day, we want somewhere to jump on, play with people we
          know, have some good matches, and unwind.
        </p>
        <p>
          We're not trying to build the biggest WARDOGS community.
          <strong>We're trying to build one worth coming back to.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="community-launch">
      <div>
        <p class="section-index">COMMUNITY SERVER / LAUNCH</p>
        <h2>A CONSISTENT<br />HOME FROM<br />DAY ONE.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="community-launch-copy">
        <p>
          End of Day will host its own WARDOGS community server at launch,
          giving the group a consistent place to play from day one.
        </p>
        <p>
          Expect active admins, a low-drama environment, and a community
          focused on teamwork without taking itself too seriously.
        </p>
        <a class="inline-link" href="/server">VIEW EOD SERVER INFORMATION</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="community-fit">
      <div class="community-fit-heading">
        <p class="section-index">WHO FITS IN AT EOD?</p>
        <h2>BE SOMEONE PEOPLE<br />ARE HAPPY TO SEE LOG IN.</h2>
        <p>
          You don't need to be a hardcore milsim player, and you don't need to
          play every night. Communicate, play the objective, help newer players,
          and leave the drama somewhere else.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="community-fit-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <strong>TEAMWORK</strong>
          <p>Coordinate when it matters and help the team without pretending the game is a job.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <strong>FAMILIAR NAMES</strong>
          <p>Show up often enough to become part of the server, not another anonymous player.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <strong>LOW DRAMA</strong>
          <p>Play hard, have a laugh, and don't make everybody else's night miserable.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="subpage-cta">
      <div>
        <small>COMMUNITY OPEN NOW</small>
        <p>Meet the regulars before the EOD server goes live.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-accent" href={site.discordUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        JOIN END OF DAY
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
